      "interpretation": "Background context notes that RO membranes effectively remove long- and short-chain PFAS from feedwater, but this study focuses on PFAS present in the membrane material itself and their potential to leach and recontaminate permeate, not on measuring removal performance in a treatment train.",
      "reported_term": "PFAS removal by RO and potential recontamination via membrane-derived PFAS"
