      "statement": "PFOS and PFOA (including branched and linear PFOS), along with PFBA, PFHxA, PFNA, and other targeted PFAS, were present in all tested RO membranes, indicating that membrane materials themselves are PFAS-containing residuals in RO-based drinking water systems and can serve as a source of PFAS to permeate via leaching."
